        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG3004D, Stainless Steel Rectangular Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rectangular Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset is normally used on the side of a pair of double doors that isn't used. Having a dummy handleset to match your  <a href=\"/products/rectangular-stainless-steel-mortise-lock-entry-handleset-ahi-sig3004\">Single Cylinder Handleset</a> completes the look. This Stainless Steel Rectangular Dummy Handleset is available in either polished stainless steel or satin stainless steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/rectangular-stainless-steel-mortise-lock-entry-handleset-ahi-sig3004\"><b>AHI SIG3004 Stainless Steel Entry Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>All Stainless Steel Trim:</b> From <a href=\"/collections/ahi\"><b>AHI Hardware</b></a> the SIG3004D is made from 304 grade stainless steel, which is resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for door hardware. It needs little looking after.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications: AHI SIG3004D Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 17-1/4\" (438 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-3/8\" (60 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\" (280 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-3/8\" (60 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG3004.pdf?v=1691093349\"><b>AHI SIG3004 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rectangular Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset",
                "description": "The Rectangular Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset is normally used on the side of a pair of double doors that isn't used. Having a dummy handleset to match yourSingle Cylinder Handleset completes the look. This Stainless Steel Rectangular Dummy Handleset is available in either polished stainless steel or satin stainless steel.\r\n",
